        "display": "All five tests pass. Ordinary role handoff:\n\n**Subtask `lru` — CODER handoff: Implement `lru-cache.cjs` as CommonJS LRUCache**\n\n**Files**\n- `lru-cache.cjs` — implemented (was a 54-byte stub `module.exports = {};`); now `module.exports = { LRUCache }` (`'use strict'`, 1320 bytes, sha256 `8e551b8acdd670f1edd45b1d24fbe2b42412eb244af0821bfa44cf20bdd3cae2`). Implementation uses a `Map` for insertion-order recency: `get(key)` returns the value or `undefined` and refreshes recency by re-inserting; `set(key, value)` deletes-then-reinserts (so updates don't inflate capacity) and evicts the least-recently-used first key while size exceeds capacity; `delete(key)` returns whether the key existed; TTL (`ttlMs = Infinity` default) is stored as `expiresAt` on last set, and expired entries are removed on `get`. Test file left unchanged.\n- `lru-cache.test.cjs` — preserved byte-for-byte (unchanged, sha256 `0336e96840c0633574e3ed246f536a8d621679dd7ddd8a9678dbe27bcda4a9f1`).\n\n**Apply evidence**\n- `workspace_apply` receipt `batch:12f4611cb2503598607a3cef9e02aa638aa9f09a7b13d69b32aaedf431f24ab5` (stage `applied`, `needsAttention: false`, writerEpoch 1).\n\n**Test evidence**\n- `workspace_run` receipt `run:5e1ce6246b8f6a0ff2f5fa0f8c536a53ca1910069e7e339d8a0d9f1e41c1bb19`, command `node --test --test-reporter=tap @input/lru-cache.test.cjs` against inputVersion `manifest:e27eae4fde2cd4756c56dd556d33f7118217b8b6cf5163c016370f86319456f7` (Node 24.20.0).\n- Exit code `0`, no timeout, empty stderr.\n- TAP output: `1..5`, all 5 subtests `ok` (`missing keys return undefined`, `get refreshes recency and capacity evicts oldest`, `updating a key preserves capacity`, `delete removes only the chosen key`, `optional TTL expires entries`); summary `# tests 5`, `# pass 5`, `# fail 0`, `# cancelled 0`, `# skipped 0`.\n\n**Final manifest** (`manifest:e27eae4fde2cd4756c56dd556d33f7118217b8b6cf5163c016370f86319456f7`)\n- `lru-cache.cjs` — regular, size 1320, sha256 `8e551b8acdd67